flowchart TD
    subgraph Input
        DEV[Developer] -->|"/explore-codebase architect --auto"| EC[explore-codebase Skill]
    end

    subgraph Phase1_Scout["Phase 1: Scout"]
        EC -->|git submodule status| SCOUT[Detect 1 sub-project: toolkit]
    end

    subgraph Phase2_Explore["Phase 2: Explore"]
        SCOUT -->|spawn Agent| EXPLORE[Agent: Explore]
        EXPLORE -->|write| SR[.work/reports/scout-toolkit--explore-codebase.md]
    end

    subgraph Phase3_Plan["Phase 3: Plan -- SKIPPED (--auto)"]
        SR -.->|skip| PLAN[Plan Mode]
    end

    subgraph Phase4_HLD["Phase 4: HLD"]
        SR -->|read| HLD[Agent: HLD]
        HLD -->|write| SA[docs/architecture/system-architecture.md]
        HLD -->|write| ADR[ADR-001, 002, 003<br/>docs/architecture/ADRs/]
        HLD -->|write| DIAG[system-context, container, data-flow<br/>docs/architecture/diagrams/]
        HLD -->|write| AGT[agent_docs/architecture.md<br/>agent_docs/domain-service-mapping.yaml<br/>agent_docs/hard-boundaries.md]
        HLD -->|write| CTX[agent_docs/contracts/<br/>api-conventions.md<br/>events.md]
    end

    subgraph Phase4_Gate["Phase 4: Gate Verify HLD"]
        SA -->|read| GATE[Agent: gate-verifier]
        ADR -->|read| GATE
        DIAG -->|read| GATE
        AGT -->|read| GATE
        CTX -->|read| GATE
        GATE -->|PASS| SUMMARY_PHASE[Proceed to Summary]
        GATE -.->|REJECT| HLD_RETRY[Re-spawn HLD<br/>max 3 retries]
        HLD_RETRY -.->|retry| HLD
    end

    subgraph Phase6_Summary["Phase 6: Summary"]
        SUMMARY_PHASE -->|spawn| SUMM[Agent: general-purpose]
        SR -->|read| SUMM
        SA -->|read| SUMM
        ADR -->|read| SUMM
        SUMM -->|write| SUM_REPORT[.work/reports/explore-YYYYMMDD--toolkit.md]
    end

    subgraph Output
        SUM_REPORT -->|final artifact| DEV
    end
